  "description": "Zero-allocation pooled collections for .NET. PooledHashMap and PooledHashSet with pluggable SwissTable / Robin Hood / Linear / Chained algorithms (chosen at the type-parameter level, monomorphized by the JIT — no virtual dispatch). Also ships PooledArray<T>, PooledList<T>, PooledStack<T>, and PooledBufferWriter<T>. All collections rent arrays from ArrayPool<T>.Shared and auto-return on Dispose.",
  "id": "Prest",
